---
// The landing page's link to the book, which lives on this site at /book/.
---

<a class="book-callout not-content" href="/book/">
	<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
		<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
			<path d="M12 6.5C10.3 5.2 7.9 4.5 4.5 4.5h-1v13h1c3.4 0 5.8.7 7.5 2 1.7-1.3 4.1-2 7.5-2h1v-13h-1c-3.4 0-5.8.7-7.5 2Z" />
			<path d="M12 6.5v13" />
		</svg>
	</span>
	<span class="body">
		<span class="text">Want to learn how this works deeply, compiler engineering from scratch, and perhaps become a contributor? I wrote a book with you in mind.</span>
		<span class="cta">Read the book <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
	</span>
</a>

<style>
	.book-callout {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		width: 100%;
		min-height: 44px;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		margin-block: 0.5rem 2.5rem;
		padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 45%, transparent);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background:
			radial-gradient(120% 140% at 0% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 12%, transparent), transparent 60%),
			#070605;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.book-callout:hover,
	.book-callout:focus-visible {
		border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
		box-shadow:
			0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 35%, transparent),
			0 0 32px -4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 40%, transparent);
		outline: none;
	}
	.book-callout:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-accent-high);
		outline-offset: 3px;
	}
	.icon {
		flex: none;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		width: 2.75rem;
		height: 2.75rem;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 14%, transparent);
		color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	.body {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}
	.text {
		font-size: clamp(var(--sl-text-base), calc(0.5rem + 1.2vw), var(--sl-text-xl));
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
		overflow-wrap: break-word;
	}
	.cta {
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-accent);
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
	}
	.arrow {
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.book-callout:hover .arrow,
	.book-callout:focus-visible .arrow {
		transform: translateX(4px);
	}
	@media (max-width: 30rem) {
		.book-callout { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.book-callout, .arrow { transition: none; }
	}
</style>
